        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Defense is a push puzzle game with tower defense aspects powered by the Godot engine. Five distinct modes make up push defense and each mode will give you unique and engaging challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Defense will have the players choose between one of five distinct game modes each with its own challenges and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 15+ levels in the campaign solving push puzzles of increasing difficulty and theme as you along. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play endless levels in endless mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 10+ waves of enemies in tower defense mode push towers into place to aid you in your defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the labyrinth of obstacles to avoid or deal with enemies in your way in the game mode crush. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower placement is a game mode all about where you place towers to better deal with the coming onslaught of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These five distinct game modes will make up the entire player experience as they try this fresh spin on the push puzzle genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Defense is a push puzzle game with tower defense aspects powered by the Godot engine. Five distinct modes make up push defense and each mode will give you unique and engaging challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Defense will have the players choose between one of five distinct game modes each with its own challenges and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 15+ levels in the campaign solving push puzzles of increasing difficulty and theme as you along. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play endless levels in endless mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 10+ waves of enemies in tower defense mode push towers into place to aid you in your defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the labyrinth of obstacles to avoid or deal with enemies in your way in the game mode crush. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower placement is a game mode all about where you place towers to better deal with the coming onslaught of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These five distinct game modes will make up the entire player experience as they try this fresh spin on the push puzzle genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
